1
00:01:31,007 --> 00:01:32,884
Maki?

2
00:01:32,967 --> 00:01:35,512
She's just a small fry.

3
00:01:35,595 --> 00:01:37,222
She can't even see curses.

4
00:01:37,305 --> 00:01:39,849
Just an ordinary person
who uses Cursed Tools.

5
00:01:40,433 --> 00:01:42,310
She will forever be a Grade 4.

6
00:01:42,393 --> 00:01:45,647
I don't know why she bothers to be
a Jujutsu Sorcerer.

7
00:01:46,231 --> 00:01:47,816
Break time is over.

8
00:01:47,899 --> 00:01:49,150
Okay.

9
00:01:49,651 --> 00:01:50,652
I see.

10
00:01:51,861 --> 00:01:53,196
I feel a little relieved.

11
00:01:54,239 --> 00:01:55,198
Mai, you fool!

12
00:01:55,281 --> 00:01:57,659
This person…

13
00:01:57,742 --> 00:01:58,743
is crazy strong!

14
00:01:59,452 --> 00:02:00,703
She uses a long weapon.

15
00:02:00,787 --> 00:02:02,247
I want to get closer,

16
00:02:02,330 --> 00:02:04,415
but my hands are full
just dodging her attacks!

17
00:02:04,499 --> 00:02:06,292
If the blade was exposed,

18
00:02:07,627 --> 00:02:09,420
I would have died twice already.

19
00:02:09,504 --> 00:02:11,339
And she's a Grade 4 Jujutsu Sorcerer?

20
00:02:12,507 --> 00:02:15,677
She could probably even defeat
a Grade 2 Curse with ease!

21
00:02:17,387 --> 00:02:20,390
Speaking of which,
how is she swinging her spear

22
00:02:20,473 --> 00:02:22,183
in such a cramped fighting space?

23
00:02:42,954 --> 00:02:44,330
New Shadow Style…

24
00:02:45,415 --> 00:02:47,292
Simple Domain!

25
00:02:48,877 --> 00:02:54,299
An automatic technique that counters
all intruders within a 2.21m radius.

26
00:02:54,924 --> 00:02:58,678
It will be dispelled when both feet leave
the set point of domain expansion.

27
00:02:59,387 --> 00:03:02,765
Also, the Batto Sword Drawing
deals with oncoming enemies.

28
00:03:02,849 --> 00:03:04,601
It covers the blade with cursed energy

29
00:03:04,684 --> 00:03:06,352
and speeds up while in its hilt.

30
00:03:06,853 --> 00:03:08,813
It's New Shadow Style's fastest technique.

31
00:03:09,314 --> 00:03:11,524
Don't think about defeating her with this.

32
00:03:11,608 --> 00:03:13,902
Try to create an opening first!

33
00:03:13,985 --> 00:03:15,445
An Iai sword drawing technique?

34
00:03:15,528 --> 00:03:17,614
She must be hiding something.

35
00:03:17,697 --> 00:03:19,782
Judging from the gap,

36
00:03:19,866 --> 00:03:23,077
she probably wants to disarm
my Cursed Tool to create a flaw.

37
00:03:24,829 --> 00:03:26,706
In that case…

38
00:03:27,332 --> 00:03:28,249
She broke it!

39
00:03:28,333 --> 00:03:30,376
Is she giving up her advantage in reach?

40
00:03:32,086 --> 00:03:33,504
She threw it!

41
00:03:34,839 --> 00:03:38,218
A hidden weapon? What sharp intuition.
She's using bait to close the gap!

42
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:44,349
My feet have left the set point!

43
00:03:44,432 --> 00:03:45,308
But it's fine.

44
00:03:45,391 --> 00:03:47,977
I'll step back and lure her close…

45
00:03:51,314 --> 00:03:53,441
Aikido? She's knowledgeable!

46
00:03:54,901 --> 00:03:55,777
What?

47
00:03:56,486 --> 00:03:58,863
Your katana sword isn't too bad.

48
00:03:59,948 --> 00:04:01,199
Sword-stealing technique…

49
00:04:01,783 --> 00:04:03,034
Give it back to me.

50
00:04:08,248 --> 00:04:10,458
That kid is really interesting.

51
00:04:10,541 --> 00:04:13,503
Why don't you make her a Grade 2?

52
00:04:14,087 --> 00:04:16,214
I think so too.

53
00:04:16,297 --> 00:04:18,758
But the Zenin Family
keeps getting in my way.

54
00:04:18,841 --> 00:04:22,136
They should just be honest
and acknowledge her skills.

55
00:04:23,513 --> 00:04:26,641
I don't understand relationships
not established on monetary terms.

56
00:04:27,183 --> 00:04:29,143
You haven't changed a bit.

57
00:04:29,227 --> 00:04:33,481
Anyway, the video feed on Yuji
keeps getting disrupted.

58
00:04:33,564 --> 00:04:35,775
Animals are fickle.

59
00:04:35,858 --> 00:04:38,236
And it's tiring to share vision.

60
00:04:38,319 --> 00:04:40,655
Oh, is that so?

61
00:04:40,738 --> 00:04:43,116
Honestly, Mei, which side are you on?

62
00:04:43,199 --> 00:04:44,367
Which side?

63
00:04:44,450 --> 00:04:46,327
I side with money, of course.

64
00:04:46,411 --> 00:04:49,205
Things that can't be measured
with money have no value.

65
00:04:49,289 --> 00:04:52,458
Because it won't turn into money.

66
00:04:53,042 --> 00:04:54,961
How much did he pay you?

67
00:04:56,045 --> 00:04:58,965
I don't know what you're up to,

68
00:04:59,048 --> 00:05:03,219
but Yuji won't be manipulated
so easily now.

69
00:05:04,053 --> 00:05:05,388
Hey!

70
00:05:05,972 --> 00:05:07,515
Something's happening.

71
00:05:09,100 --> 00:05:12,603
A talisman is put
on all Cursed Spirits in the area.

72
00:05:12,687 --> 00:05:14,981
When a Cursed Spirit disappears…

73
00:05:16,524 --> 00:05:20,236
the matching talisman
in the auditorium will also disappear.

74
00:05:21,237 --> 00:05:23,698
Different elimination reactions
are produced

75
00:05:23,781 --> 00:05:26,075
based on the previously
recorded cursed energy.

76
00:05:26,659 --> 00:05:29,662
Elimination by Tokyo School
will ignite a red flame,

77
00:05:29,746 --> 00:05:33,374
while elimination by Kyoto School
will ignite a blue flame.

78
00:05:33,958 --> 00:05:35,376
As Maki is there too,

79
00:05:35,460 --> 00:05:37,712
an elimination
with unrecorded cursed energy

80
00:05:37,795 --> 00:05:39,338
will ignite a red flame as well.

81
00:05:39,964 --> 00:05:41,758
A tie?

82
00:05:41,841 --> 00:05:44,427
Everyone's just not interested
in the game.

83
00:05:44,510 --> 00:05:47,346
Why can't everyone get along?

84
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:48,931
Because they are like Utahime.

85
00:05:49,015 --> 00:05:50,933
You're the only one
I can't get along with!

86
00:05:51,017 --> 00:05:54,062
By the way, it was Panda
who eliminated the Cursed Spirit.

87
00:05:56,272 --> 00:05:58,524
Come down, you darn witch!

88
00:05:59,192 --> 00:06:01,360
I've done it a few times.

89
00:06:02,153 --> 00:06:04,363
Hurry up and catch me…

90
00:06:04,989 --> 00:06:05,865
First-year!

91
00:06:07,867 --> 00:06:10,536
Her wind of cursed energy
is strong enough to push me back.

92
00:06:10,620 --> 00:06:12,955
It's mixed with gravel
and branches. It hurts!

93
00:06:13,039 --> 00:06:15,374
If I'm careless, I'll get scratches.

94
00:06:16,501 --> 00:06:17,627
What?

95
00:06:23,549 --> 00:06:25,968
How dare you hurt my face.

96
00:06:26,552 --> 00:06:29,222
To men, a scar on the face
is like a medal.

97
00:06:30,264 --> 00:06:33,101
But to women, it's a flaw.

98
00:06:33,184 --> 00:06:34,352
What?

99
00:06:34,936 --> 00:06:37,855
Do you think Jujutsu Sorcerers
are judged based on strength?

100
00:06:37,939 --> 00:06:39,690
Isn't that the case?

101
00:06:39,774 --> 00:06:41,943
That only applies to men.

102
00:06:42,026 --> 00:06:42,985
What?

103
00:06:43,069 --> 00:06:44,612
As a woman,

104
00:06:44,695 --> 00:06:47,949
even if you're strong,
you're looked down on if you're not cute.

105
00:06:48,032 --> 00:06:52,578
Of course, you're looked down on too
if you're cute but weak.

106
00:06:53,162 --> 00:06:54,330
Do you understand?

107
00:06:54,413 --> 00:06:58,835
Female Jujutsu Sorcerers
not only have to be skilled.

108
00:06:58,918 --> 00:07:00,586
We have to be perfect.

109
00:07:01,462 --> 00:07:02,588
On top of that,

110
00:07:02,672 --> 00:07:06,217
Mai has faced discrimination
far beyond your understanding.

111
00:07:07,176 --> 00:07:10,096
I understand…

112
00:07:10,179 --> 00:07:11,848
that you're annoying!

113
00:07:17,478 --> 00:07:19,147
This girl…

114
00:07:19,230 --> 00:07:21,732
She's a first-year,
but she's used to fighting.

115
00:07:22,733 --> 00:07:25,736
She's still standing despite
being knocked down several times.

116
00:07:26,529 --> 00:07:28,239
I'm used to…

117
00:07:28,739 --> 00:07:31,117
being beaten up.

118
00:07:32,118 --> 00:07:35,121
If I increase my power, I could kill her.

119
00:07:35,621 --> 00:07:37,999
No, it's just an excuse.

120
00:07:38,082 --> 00:07:40,293
The real reason
I can't attack with full power…

121
00:07:40,793 --> 00:07:42,253
is because of Inumaki.

122
00:07:43,337 --> 00:07:45,006
Cursed Speech is a cursed technique

123
00:07:45,089 --> 00:07:47,175
that reinforces words with cursed energy.

124
00:07:47,258 --> 00:07:51,053
We just have to protect our brains
and ears with cursed energy.

125
00:07:51,637 --> 00:07:54,974
Cursed Speech is a technique
that deals with Cursed Spirits.

126
00:07:55,057 --> 00:07:56,601
Like I said just now,

127
00:07:56,684 --> 00:07:58,978
since we know
that the opponent will attack,

128
00:07:59,061 --> 00:08:00,688
it's not that scary anymore.

129
00:08:01,272 --> 00:08:04,233
On the other hand, if we don't know
when the opponent will attack,

130
00:08:04,317 --> 00:08:06,277
then we'll keep getting distracted.

131
00:08:06,944 --> 00:08:10,615
Furthermore, I'm not used to using
cursed energy to protect my head.

132
00:08:11,199 --> 00:08:13,910
It's tricky whether he's here or not.

133
00:08:14,952 --> 00:08:16,496
Is your lecture…

134
00:08:16,579 --> 00:08:17,497
over yet?

135
00:08:17,580 --> 00:08:19,790
What people expected from Mai

136
00:08:20,500 --> 00:08:22,960
wasn't simply just perfection.

137
00:08:23,628 --> 00:08:25,588
An elite Jujutsu Sorcerer family

138
00:08:25,671 --> 00:08:27,632
and one of the Three Great Families,

139
00:08:27,715 --> 00:08:28,883
the Zenin Family.

140
00:08:28,966 --> 00:08:31,636
Perfection is expected in the family.

141
00:08:31,719 --> 00:08:35,306
They inherit the cursed technique
passed down by the Zenin Family.

142
00:08:35,389 --> 00:08:36,265
Otherwise,

143
00:08:36,349 --> 00:08:39,602
you'll be an outcast
that will fall behind the rest.

144
00:08:40,186 --> 00:08:45,566
Among those, women aren't even allowed
to stand on the starting line.

145
00:08:45,650 --> 00:08:48,903
"If you're not part of the Zenin Family,
you're not a Jujutsu Sorcerer."

146
00:08:48,986 --> 00:08:52,073
"And if you're not a Jujutsu Sorcerer,
you're not a human."

147
00:08:52,156 --> 00:08:57,453
They have to serve that nasty family
despite being despised their entire lives.

148
00:08:58,621 --> 00:09:03,084
In order to achieve the life
we took for granted,

149
00:09:03,167 --> 00:09:06,420
did you know the hardships
Mai and the others went through?

150
00:09:08,172 --> 00:09:11,759
Why don't you use that brain,
who thinks of a curse as an ally,

151
00:09:12,635 --> 00:09:14,428
to think about it?

152
00:09:16,722 --> 00:09:18,558
You're so noisy.

153
00:09:18,641 --> 00:09:21,644
You think every misfortunate people
deserve forgiveness?

154
00:09:22,353 --> 00:09:23,813
Then what?

155
00:09:23,896 --> 00:09:27,400
Just because someone is fortunate,
they deserve to be ridiculed?

156
00:09:27,984 --> 00:09:30,027
That's the reason why Saori…

157
00:09:31,654 --> 00:09:33,573
Regardless of her upbringing,

158
00:09:33,656 --> 00:09:35,575
I just don't like her.

159
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:38,119
Despite their similar upbringing,

160
00:09:38,202 --> 00:09:40,288
I love Maki.

161
00:09:40,955 --> 00:09:42,248
Let me ask you.

162
00:09:42,331 --> 00:09:45,501
Have you guys ever thought about

163
00:09:46,085 --> 00:09:48,504
that fool of a human
you were going to curse?

164
00:09:49,130 --> 00:09:52,466
Why am I obliged to respond
to "perfection" or "unreasonable"?

165
00:09:53,676 --> 00:09:57,013
Is your life just a job?

166
00:09:57,096 --> 00:09:58,764
Straw Doll Technique…

167
00:09:58,848 --> 00:10:00,182
Hairpin!

168
00:10:05,605 --> 00:10:09,358
So this is why
she kept throwing and missing nails!

169
00:10:26,250 --> 00:10:29,462
Even if I lower my height,
you still can't reach me, right?

170
00:10:31,756 --> 00:10:34,300
No, I reached you!

171
00:10:35,134 --> 00:10:36,677
This is enough!

172
00:10:37,178 --> 00:10:40,348
Did she just grab one of the bristles
from my broom?

173
00:10:40,973 --> 00:10:44,393
Who cares about the difference
between boys and girls?

174
00:10:44,477 --> 00:10:47,313
Just do whatever you want!

175
00:10:47,396 --> 00:10:50,775
I like myself the most
when I dress up beautifully.

176
00:10:50,858 --> 00:10:53,861
And I like myself
when I try to become strong!

177
00:10:54,403 --> 00:10:55,780
I am…

178
00:10:57,198 --> 00:10:59,617
Nobara Kugisaki!

179
00:11:02,286 --> 00:11:04,288
I can't control my broom.

180
00:11:04,372 --> 00:11:08,000
If I hit her with my hammer,
I might end up killing her.

181
00:11:09,043 --> 00:11:10,086
If so…

182
00:11:10,711 --> 00:11:11,629
What?

183
00:11:12,213 --> 00:11:13,589
A toy hammer?

184
00:11:22,431 --> 00:11:23,891
One more hit!

185
00:11:32,316 --> 00:11:34,527
It's barely within the effective range.

186
00:11:35,194 --> 00:11:36,862
Great.

187
00:11:36,946 --> 00:11:38,531
She got hit.

188
00:11:49,990 --> 00:11:51,909
Hello, Momo.

189
00:11:53,035 --> 00:11:54,870
She's fine. It's just a rubber bullet.

190
00:11:55,371 --> 00:11:57,164
Anyway, that light just now…

191
00:11:57,248 --> 00:11:58,999
That was Ultimate Cannon, right?

192
00:11:59,500 --> 00:12:02,211
But I can't reach Mechamaru.

193
00:12:02,294 --> 00:12:06,841
If he's forced to use it,
then he might be out of the competition.

194
00:12:06,924 --> 00:12:09,135
I guess Panda will be back soon.

195
00:12:09,218 --> 00:12:12,513
Get out of there
and support everyone from the skies.

196
00:12:12,596 --> 00:12:14,432
Without you, we're doomed.

197
00:12:15,099 --> 00:12:16,100
Okay.

198
00:12:16,976 --> 00:12:19,478
Mai, I…

199
00:12:20,104 --> 00:12:21,439
It's okay, Momo.

200
00:12:21,522 --> 00:12:22,857
I understand.

201
00:12:23,524 --> 00:12:24,525
Okay.

202
00:12:25,025 --> 00:12:26,652
What's this?

203
00:12:26,735 --> 00:12:28,487
Aren't you going to call for backup?

204
00:12:29,029 --> 00:12:32,741
I'm okay with fighting two opponents.

205
00:12:32,825 --> 00:12:36,620
Everyone has a different
kind of enjoyment, right?

206
00:12:37,121 --> 00:12:39,457
Compared to everyone
working together to defeat you,

207
00:12:39,540 --> 00:12:41,834
I prefer to enjoy the fun of…

208
00:12:42,501 --> 00:12:43,711
defeating you myself.

209
00:12:43,794 --> 00:12:46,297
Call me "Big Sister,"

210
00:12:46,380 --> 00:12:47,882
my younger sister.

211
00:12:48,883 --> 00:12:51,552
What do you think of Maki?

212
00:12:51,635 --> 00:12:54,763
It feels like my answer
is going to be wrong no matter what.

213
00:12:54,847 --> 00:12:58,184
She's a very outstanding woman.

214
00:12:58,267 --> 00:13:01,020
What? I meant her as a Jujutsu Sorcerer.

215
00:13:01,103 --> 00:13:03,814
Oh, you mean that? I'm relieved.

216
00:13:05,858 --> 00:13:06,817
To be honest,

217
00:13:06,901 --> 00:13:09,528
I don't know much about Jujutsu,

218
00:13:10,321 --> 00:13:12,364
but she can fight very well.

219
00:13:12,448 --> 00:13:13,908
Maybe because of her poise?

220
00:13:13,991 --> 00:13:15,701
The way she walks is excellent.

221
00:13:15,784 --> 00:13:18,037
Maki is only a Grade 4.

222
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:19,997
What? Are you serious?

223
00:13:20,581 --> 00:13:23,334
She's from a troublesome
Jujutsu Sorcerer family.

224
00:13:24,668 --> 00:13:27,421
She sort of expelled herself
from her family,

225
00:13:27,505 --> 00:13:29,423
so they are interfering in her promotion.

226
00:13:29,507 --> 00:13:31,300
As a family of Jujutsu Sorcerers,

227
00:13:31,383 --> 00:13:33,802
wouldn't they welcome
someone strong like her?

228
00:13:33,886 --> 00:13:36,889
They won't acknowledge people
who were denied before.

229
00:13:36,972 --> 00:13:38,432
Because they are fools.

230
00:13:39,016 --> 00:13:41,477
But if Maki does well
in the Goodwill Event

231
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:44,146
and her reputation spreads,

232
00:13:44,230 --> 00:13:47,316
it will be harder for others
to suppress her.

233
00:13:47,900 --> 00:13:50,736
For this reason,
we must first win the team battle.

234
00:13:50,819 --> 00:13:53,822
You better put
your life on the line again!

235
00:13:53,906 --> 00:13:54,990
Yes.

236
00:13:55,074 --> 00:13:56,742
I heard it.

237
00:13:58,327 --> 00:13:59,495
Gosh.

238
00:14:00,454 --> 00:14:03,999
Don't think about nonsense.

239
00:14:04,083 --> 00:14:05,918
What's…

240
00:14:06,001 --> 00:14:07,753
so funny?

241
00:14:15,803 --> 00:14:18,389
So what if you can hide in my blind spot?

242
00:14:18,973 --> 00:14:20,683
Trying to distance yourself from me?

243
00:14:20,766 --> 00:14:21,850
Are you an idiot?

244
00:14:22,893 --> 00:14:25,020
Down there?

245
00:14:29,149 --> 00:14:30,192
I knew.

246
00:14:30,985 --> 00:14:34,697
Maki has the talent I lack.

247
00:14:35,614 --> 00:14:36,824
Have you heard?

248
00:14:36,907 --> 00:14:38,576
About Ogi's daughters.

249
00:14:38,659 --> 00:14:40,995
One of them not only
doesn't have cursed techniques,

250
00:14:41,078 --> 00:14:42,329
she can't even see curses.

251
00:14:42,413 --> 00:14:44,790
Are twins really a bad omen?

252
00:14:44,874 --> 00:14:47,710
Maybe it's better this way.

253
00:14:47,793 --> 00:14:51,046
She wouldn't even be noticed
since she'll serve the eldest son.

254
00:14:55,843 --> 00:14:56,802
Mai.

255
00:14:57,553 --> 00:15:00,306
What's wrong? Hurry up.

256
00:15:02,391 --> 00:15:05,185
-I don't want to.
-What's the matter?

257
00:15:05,269 --> 00:15:07,897
You'll get scolded again if you're late.

258
00:15:08,981 --> 00:15:10,316
There's something over there.

259
00:15:13,235 --> 00:15:14,945
Again?

260
00:15:16,947 --> 00:15:19,199
Guess there's no choice.

261
00:15:19,283 --> 00:15:21,160
Not at home…

262
00:15:21,243 --> 00:15:23,704
Come on. Close your eyes.

263
00:15:23,787 --> 00:15:24,788
What?

264
00:15:29,460 --> 00:15:31,503
If you can't see it,
then it doesn't exist.

265
00:15:33,923 --> 00:15:37,092
You seemed fearless since childhood.

266
00:15:37,968 --> 00:15:40,512
You stride towards the future.

267
00:15:41,180 --> 00:15:43,557
I hated you.

268
00:15:45,309 --> 00:15:48,062
Are you leaving this house, Maki?

269
00:15:48,646 --> 00:15:50,814
There are plenty of people doing chores.

270
00:15:50,898 --> 00:15:55,527
Don't worry. I'll be back soon, Master.

271
00:15:57,488 --> 00:15:59,448
Why bother coming back?

272
00:15:59,531 --> 00:16:02,910
I'll become the head of the Zenin Family!

273
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:10,334
Then I'll put you to the test.

274
00:16:12,086 --> 00:16:13,796
As you wish.

275
00:16:14,546 --> 00:16:16,256
Mai is no exception.

276
00:16:19,301 --> 00:16:21,387
This has nothing to do with her.

277
00:16:30,729 --> 00:16:32,022
Liar.

278
00:16:34,692 --> 00:16:36,610
I hate you!

279
00:17:23,198 --> 00:17:26,201
You've fired your sixth bullet.
I won't let you reload!

280
00:17:26,285 --> 00:17:27,703
I…

281
00:17:29,413 --> 00:17:31,165
hate you!

282
00:17:32,624 --> 00:17:33,959
So…

283
00:17:36,378 --> 00:17:37,796
Whether it's my first love

284
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:39,757
or my cursed technique…

285
00:17:40,716 --> 00:17:44,136
I'll never tell you!

286
00:17:45,512 --> 00:17:47,556
Construction.

287
00:17:47,639 --> 00:17:51,018
It allows one to construct something
from scratch using cursed energy.

288
00:17:51,602 --> 00:17:56,648
Unlike creating objects
within a Domain Expansion,

289
00:17:56,732 --> 00:18:00,110
things that are constructed by
this technique

290
00:18:00,194 --> 00:18:02,905
will not disappear
after the technique is finished.

291
00:18:03,947 --> 00:18:07,034
On top of that, it consumes
an immense amount of cursed energy.

292
00:18:07,117 --> 00:18:09,036
It puts a huge strain on the user's body.

293
00:18:09,787 --> 00:18:13,040
Mai can only construct one bullet a day.

294
00:18:14,374 --> 00:18:15,918
As a distraction,

295
00:18:16,001 --> 00:18:19,046
she uses a revolver,
which obviously contains six bullets.

296
00:18:20,380 --> 00:18:23,008
It's my victory.

297
00:18:29,306 --> 00:18:32,392
She caught the bullet with her hand?

298
00:18:33,102 --> 00:18:34,311
This hurts…

299
00:18:35,854 --> 00:18:38,524
I shouldn't grab it with my hand.

300
00:18:43,153 --> 00:18:46,740
Maki has the talent I lack.

301
00:18:47,533 --> 00:18:48,784
Just like Mechamaru,

302
00:18:48,867 --> 00:18:51,370
perhaps it's a reverse form
of Heavenly Restriction.

303
00:18:52,454 --> 00:18:55,374
You're supposed to be born
with a cursed technique,

304
00:18:56,250 --> 00:19:00,963
but in return, you received
superhuman physical abilities.

305
00:19:01,964 --> 00:19:04,591
A talent rejected by the Zenin Family…

306
00:19:05,175 --> 00:19:07,052
And a talent…

307
00:19:07,928 --> 00:19:09,721
that I lack.

308
00:19:10,848 --> 00:19:13,976
It's obvious who's the winner, right?

309
00:19:16,520 --> 00:19:19,231
Why did you run away from home?

310
00:19:19,314 --> 00:19:20,440
What?

311
00:19:20,524 --> 00:19:22,192
You know that, don't you?

312
00:19:22,276 --> 00:19:23,986
You came to Jujutsu High too.

313
00:19:24,069 --> 00:19:24,987
I…

314
00:19:25,696 --> 00:19:28,323
I never wanted to be a Jujutsu Sorcerer!

315
00:19:29,575 --> 00:19:30,993
It's all your fault!

316
00:19:31,076 --> 00:19:32,828
Because you worked hard,

317
00:19:32,911 --> 00:19:35,122
I had to work hard too!

318
00:19:36,081 --> 00:19:40,043
I don't want to work hard,
suffer, or be afraid anymore!

319
00:19:40,752 --> 00:19:44,089
What's wrong with being a servant at home?

320
00:19:44,173 --> 00:19:48,010
Just do odd jobs and live casually!

321
00:19:50,929 --> 00:19:55,559
Why didn't you fall down with me?

322
00:20:02,065 --> 00:20:03,317
If I do that…

323
00:20:04,401 --> 00:20:07,070
I would grow to hate myself.

324
00:20:07,738 --> 00:20:09,198
That's all.

325
00:20:10,991 --> 00:20:12,034
I'm sorry.

326
00:20:16,163 --> 00:20:19,583
Don't let go, Maki.

327
00:20:19,666 --> 00:20:21,210
I won't let go.

328
00:20:21,293 --> 00:20:22,711
You must not let go.

329
00:20:22,794 --> 00:20:24,755
You're annoying.

330
00:20:24,838 --> 00:20:27,883
You can't leave me behind, okay?

331
00:20:27,966 --> 00:20:29,885
Of course.

332
00:20:29,968 --> 00:20:31,595
We're sisters.

333
00:20:37,100 --> 00:20:38,560
Liar.

334
00:20:39,645 --> 00:20:41,605
I hate you.

335
00:20:41,688 --> 00:20:43,815
KYOTO SISTER-SCHOOL GOODWILL EVENT
TEAM BATTLE

336
00:20:43,899 --> 00:20:45,943
MAI ZENIN AND NOBARA KUGISAKI WITHDRAW

337
00:22:16,533 --> 00:22:18,452
-Juju Stroll.
-Juju Stroll.

338
00:22:25,751 --> 00:22:28,128
I'm hungry.

339
00:22:28,670 --> 00:22:33,717
I think there are edamame leftovers
from the day in the fridge.

340
00:22:38,722 --> 00:22:40,724
What?

341
00:22:46,438 --> 00:22:47,397
Sorry.

342
00:22:47,481 --> 00:22:50,859
Can you be more sincere?

343
00:22:50,942 --> 00:22:53,737
Here. Don't be angry.

344
00:22:53,820 --> 00:22:57,616
No, thanks. It's not good to eat
cup noodles at midnight.

345
00:23:00,452 --> 00:23:01,620
Try this then!

346
00:23:01,703 --> 00:23:04,623
Nishimiya-style seafood cup noodles!

347
00:23:05,332 --> 00:23:09,836
First, cut the chili into flakes
and add them to the seafood cup noodles.

348
00:23:10,504 --> 00:23:14,132
Second, pour milk
into about half of the container.

349
00:23:14,216 --> 00:23:17,385
Third, pour water
until the inner dotted line.

350
00:23:17,469 --> 00:23:20,639
As milk is added,
hot boiling water is needed.

351
00:23:25,727 --> 00:23:26,895
It's delicious!

352
00:23:27,604 --> 00:23:30,774
-This is delicious!
-I know, right?

353
00:23:30,857 --> 00:23:32,901
Maybe I'll try it next time, too.

354
00:23:32,984 --> 00:23:36,863
Since it's so delicious,
you should have just eaten this instead.

355
00:23:38,657 --> 00:23:43,120
No, I'll feel miserable the next day
if I eat cup noodles at midnight.

356
00:23:43,203 --> 00:23:45,122
I agree.
